### Account Endpoints
### Variables can be set at the top of the file or in settings
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@account = GAAZI4TCR3TY5OJHCTJC2A4QSY6CJWJH5IAJTGKIN2ER7LBNVKOCCWN7
@apiKey = 

### Get Account Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/balances
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/payments?limit=10&order=desc
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/transactions?limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Operations
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/operations?limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Trades
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/trades?limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Effects
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/effects?limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Offers
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/offers
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Signers
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/signers
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Risk Assessment
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/risk
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Multisig Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/multisig
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Multisig Plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/multisig-plan
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/data
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Pool Positions
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/pool-positions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Sponsorships
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/sponsorships
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Claimable Balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/claimable-balances
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/timeline?limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Account Transaction Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/{{account}}/transaction-count
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
